<title>CYPRUS: Rate on 91 day Cyprus t-bills at 5.47 pct.</title>
<headline>Rate on 91 day Cyprus t-bills at 5.47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bank of Cyprus   on</p>
<p>Wednesday sold 20.1 million pounds ($52.3 million) of 91-day treasury bills with a coupon of 5.47 percent from 5.68 percent at the last auction on January 8.</p>
<p>A central bank statement said it received competitive and non competitive bids for bills totalling 34.3 million pounds.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
